    growthMeasures: "Holt-Lunstad et al. (2010): OR 1.50 for survival with stronger social relationships across 148 studies. Naito et al. (2023): HR 1.33 pooled; regionally lower in Asia. Honest limit: both are dominated by high-income Western cohorts, and neither adequately samples Sub-Saharan Africa or Latin America, so 'global' is aspirational.",
