    connectionCase: "The DIRECTION generalizes about as well as any finding in this literature: Kumar et al. (2012), using Gallup World Poll data from 139 countries (~272,000 adults), found associations of social support with self-rated health were CONSISTENTLY POSITIVE across cultural, economic and geographic settings. This is among the strongest genuinely cross-national evidence that perceived support tracks health nearly everywhere it has been measured.",
