    pattern: "Certain humor styles function as a coping resource: reframing adversity and generating self-directed levity buffers stress and supports well-being. The effect is style-specific, not humor in general, benign, self-enhancing, and affiliative humor helps, while hostile or self-putdown humor does not.",
