    connectionCase: "Across 94 independent tests (N > 8,000), forming an if-then plan on top of a goal added a medium-to-large effect on attainment (d ~ 0.65), helping initiation, shielding against derailment, and disengagement from failing courses (Gollwitzer & Sheeran, 2006).",
