    untreatedTrajectory: "Mere experience plateaus: once performance becomes automatic, additional hours without targeted, feedback-rich stretch produce little further gain (Ericsson, Krampe & Tesch-Romer, 1993). And the honest limit: deliberate practice is necessary but far from sufficient — it does not explain most of the variance in performance (Macnamara, Hambrick & Oswald, 2014).",
